{"id":"6ae44e6a67df968f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-rasmussen-invariant.md","title":"Rasmussen Invariant","display":"df-rasmussen-invariant — Rasmussen Invariant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rasmussen-invariant","aliases":["58-df-rasmussen-invariant"],"display":"df-rasmussen-invariant — Rasmussen Invariant","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md]]","[[58-df-lee-homology-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rasmussen-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rasmussen-invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rasmussen-invariant — Rasmussen Invariant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0cea8c71c1f6767\" href=\"?note=d0cea8c71c1f6767\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md\">../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d2a105faa1b4258\" href=\"?note=5d2a105faa1b4258\" title=\"58-df-lee-homology-data.md\">58-df-lee-homology-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,H,d\\in V\">\\(K,H,d\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2a105faa1b4258\" href=\"?note=5d2a105faa1b4258\" title=\"58-df-lee-homology-data.md\">58-df-lee-homology-data.md</a> 中的实际 Lee 复形与商滤过；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(d)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\)</span> 恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的非零同调类载体。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)\\)</span> 保留原有四个实参，由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rasmussen\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\land s\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(a\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\;(a\\le r\\le b)\\land2s=a+b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rasmussen\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\land s\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(a\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\;(a\\le r\\le b)\\land2s=a+b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仍为非零 Lee 同调类滤过次数的最小值与最大值的平均。用有见证的极值条件代替未限定域的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min/\\max\">\\(\\min/\\max\\)</span>，不改变取值归一化。</li>\n<li>原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(H\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 的零元现由 Lee 商空间和同一重标记双射确定，不把集合论的空集无条件当作任意同调空间的零元。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jacob Rasmussen, <em>Khovanov homology and the slice genus</em>, Definitions 3.1 and 3.4.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0cea8c71c1f6767","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lee-homology-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2a105faa1b4258","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lee-homology-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lee-homology-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2a105faa1b4258","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)$ 使用 [[58-df-lee-homology-data.md]] 中的实际 Lee 复形与商滤过；$\\operatorname{dom}(d)$ 恰是 $H$ 的非零同调类载体。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,H,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rasmussen\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RasmussenInvariant}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,K,H,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LeeHomologyData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(H,d,K)\\land s\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(a\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(d)\\;(a\\le r\\le b)\\land2s=a+b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\min/\\max","display":false},{"tex":"H\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1557,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1040","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-rasmussen-invariant.md|58-df-rasmussen-invariant]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["d0cea8c71c1f6767","5d2a105faa1b4258"]}